{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾經風靡全球的電子寵物遊戲機「他媽哥池」，是不少8、90後的童年回憶，今年適逢誕生30周年，特別與運動品牌PUMA攜手推出「PUMA × TAMAGOTCHI」聯名系列，將可愛的電子寵物角色融入經典波鞋及服飾設計之中，帶來充滿童趣與懷舊氣息</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:16:24.595857+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:00:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:35.630117+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:35.630117+00:00","content_hash":"4a6de3e7a9b59f9355c113198a573dabcf69b55c1406232e94a7c7c80c34015f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}